{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5a3b0c84369802d2c7d9384ef41c296256928c58cb6170f6cc43ca6d94375cbf", "ja": "（千鶴さんの新しい衣装が届いた。華やかさや柔らかさ\nを取り入れつつ、上品な形に仕上げてもらったが……）", "zh": "（千鹤的新服装送到了。融入了华丽感和柔和感，做成了优雅的款式，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "a4601b200a6adc050fba9d96937032c997da9ff609a278063b45ea1c68be27b3", "ja": "ふふっ。こうした衣装も着こなせてこそ、\nセレブというものですわね。", "zh": "呵呵。能驾驭这样的服装，才称得上是名媛嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "a91020ecde57b67d40f4b62a0f079720a8af1981186ae6d58d959be234943de2", "ja": "いかがかしら。{$P$}の\n期待には応えられまして？", "zh": "觉得怎么样？有没有满足{$P$}的期待呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f35cf9aeff1e9920a455452e768dba23cf1efd72184bebf0fa1c6e3cfd0ded46", "ja": "もちろん、バッチリです！\n千鶴さんに、よく似合ってると思います。", "zh": "当然，非常完美！\n我觉得很适合千鹤小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "9c7cb968c82001c12f2a7264856a21693df442cc8caf0b51c366473c5f430db5", "ja": "それを聞いて安心しましたわ。\n実を言うと、少しだけ心配していましたの。", "zh": "听你这么说我就放心了。其实，我刚才还有一点担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "c30d1b1f71714f5e38ca79f56d512c3f29eaa62ed14bb06c6ff517726adc5ab0", "ja": "わたくしがセレブらしく着こなそうとするあまり、衣装\nの愛らしさを打ち消してしまうのではないかと……。", "zh": "我还在担心，自己要是太拘泥于穿出名媛气质，\n会不会抹煞了服装原有的可爱呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8f10420f49abcecb1f0312dcc10b2c7a25f5ac62c460992d5ecf8980d59f4971", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ。千鶴さんはセレブらしいからこそ、\nつねに初々しいですから。", "zh": "没问题的。千鹤小姐正因有着名媛风范，\n才始终保持着这份纯真呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "e64685b67dcd9b80697e41a713d5e7ac44b1e8a65060ccc087ae909f9ffc1738", "ja": "初々しさ……なるほど。それは、\n小さい頃の思い出のせいかもしれませんわね。", "zh": "青涩感……原来如此。或许是因为小时候的回忆吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "7f105ef09b8b58c22aae987520822716691f412ad07480fee43182f77949bff0", "ja": "わたくし、ずっと欲しかったお人形がありましたの。\nとても綺麗で可愛らしいドレスを着ていて……。", "zh": "我以前，一直很想要一个洋娃娃。\n身上穿着非常漂亮又可爱的小洋装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "40391c3b97e85dfd0ccbaff4199a8d1a195ae3a8479ef7b1b0cabda4b7b0f1ec", "ja": "ショーケースの中でいつもキラキラと輝いていました。\nそのお人形を眺めるのが、わたくしは大好きでしたわ。", "zh": "它一直在展示柜里闪闪发光。\n我最喜欢静静地欣赏那个洋娃娃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b47206680149bc230c0a290a849deb3fbd264be014fa85510a2c8256068cfffd", "ja": "そうだったんですね。\n……やっぱり、千鶴さんらしいと思います。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n……我果然觉得，这很像千鹤小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "22af43536c193b15abc9a87e0f0e22cc72e1dcf5f9b94d4ac5237a66663bb2ab", "ja": "ふふっ、自分ではよくわかりませんけれど。そういう\n純粋な気持ちは、いつまでも大切にしたいものです。", "zh": "呵呵，我自己倒是不太明白。不过，这份纯粹的心情，我想无论何时都要好好珍惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "27228fd35f435fd5f74c37fa6b19add8725ef37e322ee3d46955df089cb46ee8", "ja": "まさに、『初心忘れるべからず』ですわね！", "zh": "正所谓，“不忘初心”呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dc5d43637225a0a0201f703ff3d1d991db5b29b2e4f061d04ef3c7a5439feb4e", "ja": "そうですね、気をつけます。\nあ、千鶴さんは大丈夫だと思いますよ！", "zh": "是啊，我会注意的。\n啊，我觉得千鹤应该没问题哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "f5e08ae712a400dd849ca5267bcb7246604b4b38ae35cbb653aae6f309da6890", "ja": "まあ、お上手ですこと。\nそのお言葉、そっくりそのままお返しいたしますわ。", "zh": "哎呀，您可真会说话。\n这句话，我就原封不动地奉还给您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "1f9494a3470dc5a5c61243f245de11fc32017a506ae00d77a18b97d054161a64", "ja": "それに、わたくしは当然のことを\nしているだけですもの。", "zh": "而且，我只是在做理所当然的事情而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "320d3bd4e23143ee8715d1f63d666a4cbd1b7c19bbbaa0f4fca10aefef9b014f", "ja": "いつも応援してくださるファンのみなさまに、\n素直な気持ちを届けていきたい……。", "zh": "我想把坦率的心意传达给一直支持我的各位粉丝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "867b4d78fc11c3981495018641044212c73a621cfa93ac41da341b64d4f4aa58", "ja": "劇場の仲間達に、わたくしを支えてくださる方々に。\n……すべての、大切な方々に。", "zh": "致剧场的伙伴们，以及支持着我的各位。\n……致所有重要的人们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a10a9e71f712471f1fe891b61104167f251b8ca276b4a049bcc769cef152c094", "ja": "はい、届けていきましょう。\n二人で一緒に。", "zh": "好的，让我们一起传达出去吧。\n两个人一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_038chz0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_038chz0444_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "38411660d8b9d64199a1c35e47e1e02b130aaf9e83c44b11f3ae7865cb9467af", "ja": "ええ、ふたりで一緒に。\nお願いいたしますわね、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯，两个人一起去传达吧。\n拜托你了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
